      {
        "id": "prm-object-141579",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Long flared dress (kosulja) with bell sleeves; made from undyed cotton or linen sewn in panels. Heavily decorated: woven wool in panels of black, red, maroon with embroidery in gold & silver thread are sewn onto the dress at wrists and up arms - the patterns are reminiscent of oriental carpets. The hem has panels of embroidery, some differing from each other but generally in \"carpet\" patterns in red, white, beige, light green; along the hem is a strip of maroon wool with sequins sewn on. The stand-up collar and the two panels along the neck opening are embroidered like the sleeves with beads also sewn along edges and four rows of Turkish coins sewn onto the left front opening. Part of woman's dance costume 1981.35.11-22.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576053_1981.0035.23.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141579"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141581",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Waistcoat, jelek. Coarse natural cotton or linen panels form a little jacket, which the donor embroidered herself with red & black piping around all edges, and yellow, white and maroon stitching on black & red felt in geometric patterns with silver sequins added. Worn over dress 1981.35.23, along with a few other waistcoats worn on top of each other. Part of complete woman's costume 1981.35.23-30.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576054_1981.0035.24.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141581"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141585",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Scarf/head-piece, part of complete woman's costume 1981.35.23-30. Long narrow rectangle of natural cotton or linen, with red, maroon & black wool embroidery along edges. At each end a thick piece of woven wool (black, red, maroon, silver & gold threads) is sewn (it is similar to the weave on the apron (1981.35.25). These end pieces are decorated with black, white & brass beads and long red fringes. Worn over the forehead with the long ends hanging down the back; it is secured by the headpiece (1981.35.29).",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576058_1981.0035.28.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141585"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141572",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Apron. Two panels of elaborately woven coloured wools in geometric patterns are joined together horizontally across centre. Influenced by Albanian designs. Predominant colours are red & black, with green, white, blue, magenta, maroon & gold & silver. The apron ties at the waist; drawstrings missing. Machine-made lace around edges. Possibly part of woman's dance costume 1981.35.11-22",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576044_1981.0035.15.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141572"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141574",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Pair of socks, carape. Knitted black wool background with two bands of blue, magenta, green & white patterns knitted in. Drawstring tops. Part of woman's dance costume 1981.35.11-22.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576046_1981.0035.17.1-2.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141574"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141580",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Pin, to be worn on a scarf, perhaps over the ear. A triangular shaped ?brass plaque is decorated with metal filagree and glass beads and a tiny filagree bird which moves around. Eight chains are suspended from the main piece - each ends in a tiny metal ball. There is a long pin in the back. Part of complete woman's costume 1981.35.23-30.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576052_1981.0035.22.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141580"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141583",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Belt, pojas with large buckle, pofta. Long handwoven wool strip in red, green, black & white stripes; braided fringe at each end. Worn wound round the waist and secured with the buckle. Two massive discs of repoussé ?silver hook together underneath a central disc.  Of right type to be worn with complete woman's costume 1981.35.23-30.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576056_1981.0035.26.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141583"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141586",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Head ornament, part of complete woman's costume 1981.35.23-30.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576059_1981.0035.29.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141586"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141587",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Pair of socks, carape. Red, black, white, yellow, blue wool knitted into geometric patterns all over.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576061_1981.0035.30.1.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141587"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141568",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Long white cotton dress, kosulja, with bell sleeves; pillow lace at hem. Embroidery done in black, red, green, blue & gold thread by donor on English material which was then sewn onto the frock in panels at the neck, front opening, wrists and back hem. Embroidery patterns taken from a book on Balkan regional styles. Part of woman's dance costume 1981.35.11-22.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576040_1981.0035.11.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141568"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141573",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Apron similar to 1981.35.15. Possibly part of woman's dance costume 1981.35.11-22.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576045_1981.0035.16.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141573"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141575",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Belt, pojas, with buckle, pofta. Long woven wool strip with braided fringe at ends; blue, orange, white, yellow, red in geometric patterns. Buckle is made from two large discs, white metal with repoussé floral patterns, which hook together.   The belt is adjustable; perhaps 2 or 3 of these strips would be worn wrapped around the waist. Part of woman's dance costume 1981.35.11-22.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS576047_1981.0035.18.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141575"
      },
      {
        "id": "prm-object-141582",
        "source": "prm",
        "title": "Apron, large and heavy, made from two panels of black, red, maroon & yellow wool woven in a strange technique (almost an embroidery) to produce geometric carpet-type patterns similar to those on the sleeves of the dress (1981.35.23). Decorated near hem with a heavy piece of thick wool with bands of red, maroon, black fringe; wide ribbons of gold thread and lines of black, white & brass beads. Commercial cord for tying around waist at top edges. Part of complete woman's costume 1981.35.23-30.",
        "image": "https://prm-online-collections-assets-prd.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/assets/PRM_RS401147_1981.0035.25.jpg",
        "object_url": "https://www.prm.ox.ac.uk/collections-online#/item/prm-object-141582"
      },
